⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Magics
node ARN · ARN · ⟦The Magics:ARN:31fc5e⟧

WHO   — The Magics — mana and the colours, in prose
WHAT  — The prose engine of the game: before any lore, the author had to translate cast-summon-attack into a novel, and ‘colorless’ Garth into a hero.
WHERE — ARN · Arena  Framework inputs: Arena (Forstchen, 1994)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because someone had to put the card game into words first — and the choices here echoed forward into the cards themselves.
HOW   — By mages spending power, summoning creatures, and casting effects a player would recognise from their hand.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I am the card game turned to prose — mana, summons, and colours before the lore existed; and the ‘colorless’ choice that made Garth a five-colour card.

